{"unit_id":"qiaoy01__dsh-mission#card-zh","repo":"qiaoy01/dsh-mission","commit":"4bd62d0313cfdd319b551bb71af79064e3b2dcf2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mission 是 DeepSeek Harness 的长程任务运行时，适用于需要跨多轮持续推进目标的 agent 工作。它把目标保存为带依赖关系的任务计划，并由后台驱动器按优先级认领可执行任务、派发子代理、记录结果并独立验证。任务状态写入所属会话事件流，支持状态查询、取消、过期租约回收和失败后重规划；任务计划可通过模型工具创建和提交，也可使用 /mission 入口。适合需要断点恢复、依赖编排和验证流程的长期工作。插件依赖 Harness 的 agent、session、subagent 和 tools 服务，默认使用确定性任务选择，不要求额外模型配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-37","src/tools.ts:33-109","src/driver.ts:105-167","src/service.ts:96-181"]}
{"unit_id":"qiaoy01__dsh-mission#card-en","repo":"qiaoy01/dsh-mission","commit":"4bd62d0313cfdd319b551bb71af79064e3b2dcf2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mission runs dependency-based missions in DeepSeek Harness. It stores plans in session events, dispatches ready tasks to subagents, and verifies outcomes. Users can inspect or cancel missions; failed plans can be revised while completed tasks remain done. Deterministic selection is the default.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-37","src/tools.ts:33-109","src/driver.ts:105-167","src/service.ts:96-181"]}
